            <section>
               <title value="Hospital course note"/>
               <code>
                  <coding>
                     <system value="http://loinc.org"/>
                     <code value="8648-8"/>
                     <display value="Hospital course note"/>
                  </coding>
               </code>
               <text>
                  <status value="generated"/>
                  <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Dear colleague, I am writing to inform you regarding our mutual patient, a 69-year-old male admitted on 30/01/2024 with decompensated chronic congestive heart failure. On admission, the patient presented with significant fluid overload, peripheral oedema, and dyspnoea at rest. Diagnostic workup included echocardiography confirming reduced ejection fraction, chest X-ray demonstrating pulmonary congestion, and laboratory assessment revealing elevated BNP levels and mild renal impairment. We initiated intravenous diuretic therapy with furosemide, achieving satisfactory diuresis with notable symptomatic improvement. Cardiac medication was optimised, including ACE inhibitor and beta-blocker titration. The patient was discharged on 01/02/2024 in a clinically stable and compensated condition. Please arrange close outpatient follow-up within two weeks and monitor renal function and electrolytes. Should you have any questions, please do not hesitate to contact me.</div>
               </text>
            </section>
